      "id": 11,
      "title": "Shadow checks that did not match",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Every result but match over the range: mismatch and error are disagreements; skipped, skip_* and status_* are what was not compared, and why.",
